Fixed: With Taskflow, parallel::apply_to_subranges() used std::advance() to
get to the beginning of each subrange, which is O(N) for iterators that are
not random access, such as Triangulation::active_cell_iterator. Ranges of such
iterators are now no longer split into subranges.
